<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners net sellers of SAfrica shares last week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net sellers of SAfrica shares last week.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Johannesburg Stock Exchange (JSE) said non-residents were net seller of 81.63 million rand worth of South African shares on the exchange last week.</p>
<p>Non-resident transactions (million rand) -</p>
<p>			Week to Nov 29   Year to date   Year ago</p>
<p>Equities:</p>
<p>- purchases		 701.48     37,428.82	22,162.59</p>
<p>- sales		     783.11     32,679.87	17,572.27</p>
<p>- net purchases/(sales) (81.63)     4,748.95	 4,590.32</p>
<p>NOTE - The figures reflect only the portion of the market where non-resident transactions are executed through the JSE, and are therefore not comprehensive.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
